Package: librosa-termux
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: python, python-pip, python-numpy, python-scipy, python-llvmlite, python-soxr, python-msgpack, scikit-learn-termux, soundfile-termux, ffmpeg, clang, make
Section: python
Priority: optional
Description: librosa for Termux - audio features (MFCC, mel, tempo)
 apt installs NumPy, SciPy, llvmlite, soxr, scikit-learn and SoundFile;
 the install step builds numba with pip (10-20 min) and installs
 librosa. Commands: librosa-setup, librosa-check.
